id=rdc_nativecloak
name=RDC NativeCloak
version=v0.1.0
versionCode=1
author=Redroid Device Center
description=Native-layer container trace cleansing for Redroid Device Center. PLT-hooks openat to sanitize /proc/self/cgroup, /proc/self/mountinfo and /proc/mounts (docker remnants removed), and serves profile-matched eglQueryString/glGetString strings from /data/local/tmp/rdc-cloak.json. Companion of the DeviceCloak LSPosed module (framework APIs), not a replacement.
